Musoq — SQL for files, APIs, databases, tools, and cloud services

Start Here
Start here:       musoq describe
Machine contract: musoq describe --format json

Usage: musoq <command>

Query
  run        Run SQL from text, a file, or a saved script
  watch      Run queries and compare durable state when inputs change
  inspect    Inspect a query without executing it
  infer      Generate queries from input files
  log        Review recent query execution logs
  separator  Insert a separator into the input stream
  execution  Inspect active query executions

Manage
  data-sources (alias: datasource)  Install and manage data sources
  registry                          Manage data source registries
  path                              Manage named query paths
  script                            Manage saved SQL scripts
  tool                              Manage reusable tools
  bucket                            Manage storage buckets
  mcp                               Manage isolated tool contexts
  image                             Manipulate image files
  cache                             Manage local caches

Configure
  get    Read configuration and system information
  set    Set configuration values
  clear  Clear configuration values

System
  doctor      Diagnose the local environment
  serve       Start the Musoq CLI service
  quit        Stop the Musoq CLI service
  completion  Generate shell completion scripts

Reference
  describe  Start here to discover and use Musoq
  manual    Read the offline user manual
  spec      Read Musoq reference documents

Help:  musoq <command> --help
